<title>UK: TABLE - Hyder year pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hyder year pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		118.6		  vs 68.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 29.3		   vs 26.1</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 43.9		   vs 38.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     208.2		  vs 112.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,140.2		vs 651.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 206.3 and 212 million stg.</p>
<p>Year-ago profits included restructuring charges of 55 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Hyder Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
